    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-ληπτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that may be taken hold of</i>, of loose skin, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				719b6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>comprehending</i>, i.e. <i>understanding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τρόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Nat.</u>
					28.2
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>with comprehension</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.6U.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>comprehending, including</i> (as the greater the less), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.428d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1003d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					40.13
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				285.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καθολικὸν π. τῶν ἐπὶ μέρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					11.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.143
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				143
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.858S.
			</span></i>; <i>collective</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					637.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				p.87S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				264.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα</span>, in Rhet., Ulp.ad
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.63
			</span></i>.</div>
